flowchart TB
  caller[Scan CLI / schedule runner] --> wire[v9 to v8 to v7 to v6 to v5 composition]
  wire --> core[v5 native / MCP / toolchain adapters]
  core --> run[command.run: close / timeout / output limit]
  run --> parse[Product-specific parse and exit checks]
  parse -- malformed / timeout / unavailable --> unknown[Missing or unverified / preserve reason]
  parse -- valid --> project[Project product status / fixed checks]
  project --> caveat[Caveat components: warn / stable fingerprint]
  project --> server[Server readiness: fatal or high]
  project --> toolchain[Version comparison / integration / last_update]
  caveat --> report[Report with original generation contracts]
  server --> report
  toolchain --> report
  unknown --> report
  wire --> added[Peertable / Unai / Jev adapters]
  added --> report
  report --> output[Validate / report and separate ACK metadata files]
  output --> delivery[Existing queue / acceptance / ACK / receipt]
  managed[Optional managed Caveat port] --> descriptor[Before descriptor / invoke / after descriptor]
  descriptor --> binding[Binding check added without replacing raw diagnostic]
  binding --> core
  descriptor --> collector[Product-owned inventory / pinned metadata reader / identity hashes]
  deeper[Isolated private evidence validation and retention / no native worker] -. no runtime integration .-> descriptor
  core -- runner throw / revision failure --> failure[Caller failure / no completed new report]
  note[Ordinary current scan emits empty ACK list]
